{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last pilot left to take to the skies while the enemy has already claimed space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is in flames. Your fleet is almost destroyed. Only you and your starfighter remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Flame: Starfighter is not just another arcade scrolling shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a test of your reflexes, endurance, and survival skills in a chaos where there\u2019s no room for mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/extras/be1265e6fc859a7c53b07dc5c35961a7.poster.avif?t=1760137361\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/extras/be1265e6fc859a7c53b07dc5c35961a7.webm?t=1760137361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/extras/be1265e6fc859a7c53b07dc5c35961a7.mp4?t=1760137361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll start with simple skirmishes, but soon you\u2019ll be thrown into a real hail of bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision counts: boost your shields or upgrade your guns? Use your super bomb now or save it for the boss fight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, every battle is a challenge, every upgrade is a chance to survive a little longer, and every mission is a step closer to a new encounter, where the enemy is stronger and deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits the pilot:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrenaline and speed: nonstop gameplay where even a moment of distraction can mean death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship upgrades: from basic cannons to energy bombs, electro guns, and support drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic bosses: massive enemies that unleash a storm of fire and test your nerves to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 diverse missions: from station skirmishes to clashes with enormous fleets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectacular 3D graphics and special effects: turning every battle into a cosmic show.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade spirit: simple controls, but a real challenge for fans of classic shooters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Flame: Starfighter is a fast-paced space shoot \u2018em up in the finest traditions of the bullet hell genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your starfighter, upgrade your weapons, and survive the onslaught of enemy fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for those who miss classic arcades and want to test themselves in a modern scrolling shooter. There\u2019s nothing extra\u2014just you, your ship, and an endless cosmic war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990840?t=1760137361","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/0f931861637756821159064f57611b35c8d1bebe/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760137361","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/2e0431760621d161b8a023d93b06ef66a6c0d1ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760137361","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/2e0431760621d161b8a023d93b06ef66a6c0d1ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760137361","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4020180,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last pilot left to take to the skies while the enemy has already claimed space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your base is in flames. Your fleet is almost destroyed. Only you and your starfighter remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Flame: Starfighter is not just another arcade scrolling shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a test of your reflexes, endurance, and survival skills in a chaos where there\u2019s no room for mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/extras/be1265e6fc859a7c53b07dc5c35961a7.poster.avif?t=1760137361\" width=1170 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/extras/be1265e6fc859a7c53b07dc5c35961a7.webm?t=1760137361\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/extras/be1265e6fc859a7c53b07dc5c35961a7.mp4?t=1760137361\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll start with simple skirmishes, but soon you\u2019ll be thrown into a real hail of bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision counts: boost your shields or upgrade your guns? Use your super bomb now or save it for the boss fight?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, every battle is a challenge, every upgrade is a chance to survive a little longer, and every mission is a step closer to a new encounter, where the enemy is stronger and deadlier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What awaits the pilot:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrenaline and speed: nonstop gameplay where even a moment of distraction can mean death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship upgrades: from basic cannons to energy bombs, electro guns, and support drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic bosses: massive enemies that unleash a storm of fire and test your nerves to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 diverse missions: from station skirmishes to clashes with enormous fleets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spectacular 3D graphics and special effects: turning every battle into a cosmic show.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade spirit: simple controls, but a real challenge for fans of classic shooters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astro Flame: Starfighter is a fast-paced space shoot \u2018em up in the finest traditions of the bullet hell genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot your starfighter, upgrade your weapons, and survive the onslaught of enemy fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for those who miss classic arcades and want to test themselves in a modern scrolling shooter. There\u2019s nothing extra\u2014just you, your ship, and an endless cosmic war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Satur Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990840/a4783c052eec1c4acd14f908892655604ebc5ae8/header.jpg?t=1760137361","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul clas